msgstr ""

#: ../../../introduction/statistics.rst:66 f24901b32d3542f495a645e8cababf76
msgid "Where can I find the raw data and source code?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../introduction/statistics.rst:69 604a9809210b4c9a802dd708adad04a7
msgid ""
"The raw data is available `here <https://tools.qubes-os.org/counter/"
"stats.json>`__. (This does not include any personally-identifying user "
"data.) Please note that the format of this data is not documented and may "
"change any time if the developers feel the need to include something else. "
"The source code is available `here <https://github.com/woju/qubes-stats>`__."
msgstr ""
